                                                      "Position of an instant, expressed using xsd:gYear"@en ;
                                         rdfs:label "en año gregoriano XSD"@es ,
                                                    "in XSD g-Year"@en ;
                                         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Posición de un instante, expresado utilizando xsd:gYear."@es ,
                                                                                          "Position of an instant, expressed using xsd:gYear"@en .


